  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fond. Hirondelle/Radio Tunisia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fond. Hirondelle/Tunisiska radion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med projektet &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka den tunisiska radions kapacity f&#xf6;r att tillhandah&#xe5;lla befolkningen gratis, balanserad och korrekt        rapportering fr&#xe5;n grundlagsf&#xf6;rsamlingens arbete och fr&#xe5;n de kommande  valen. Syftet &#xe4;r ocks&#xe5; att st&#xe4;rka relationerna mellan valda politiker och v&#xe4;ljare/civilt samh&#xe4;lle.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to enhance the Tunisian Radio&#xb4;s capability  to provide free, balanced and accurate coverage of the work of the    Constituent National Assembly and the coming general elections for    all Tunisian citizens. The project aims to stimulate debate about     political life between politicians and civil society, as well as to   promote closer ties between the elected representatives and citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
